<title>EL SALVADOR: SOCCER-CANADA BEAT EL SALVADOR 2-0 IN WORLD CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-CANADA BEAT EL SALVADOR 2-0 IN WORLD CUP.</headline>
<dateline>SAN SALVADOR 1996-12-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canada beat El Salvador</p>
<p>2-0 (halftime 0-0) in a CONCACAF semifinal stage group two</p>
<p>World Cup qualifying match on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Mark Watson (61st minute), Alex Burnbury (78th)</p>
<p>Note: both teams had already qualified for the final stage</p>
<p>before the game.</p>
</text>
